= The <span style="color: #000000;">**GcG**</span>

Current Leader: [? if gcg_leader = "Imbusch" : Heinrich Imbusch ?][? if gcg_leader = 'Otte': Bernhard Otte ?]

Dominant Union: Christian Miners' Union (CMV)

flavortext

- @imbusch: Support Imbusch’s policies of confrontation
- @union_coop: Forge closer ties with the <span style="color: #c00000;">**ADGB**</span> and <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**HDU**</span>
- @newspaper: Fund the Westdeutschen Arbeiterzeitung, a prominent Catholic workers newspaper
- @root: We either don't want to do anything right now
- @easy_discard

@imbusch
subtitle: Imbusch supports a more miltant trade unionism compared to Stegerwald's concillation, similar to the <span style="color: #c00000;">**ADGB**</span>.
view-if: rubicon_crossed = 1
on-arrival: workers_z += 1*(1-dissent); workers_z -= 1/3 if unemployed >= 15; workers_z -= 1/3 if unemployed >= 25; workers_z += 2*(1-dissent) if peoples_party == 1; resources -= 3

This has galvanised our union members amidst growing unemployment and poverty, stabilising our membership for now. However, the industrialist and middle class elements of the party are wary of this shift towards the left.

@union_coop
subtitle: With cooperation running back to the period of the revolution, deepening our ties with them can aid us in the fight for workers' rights and welfare.
on-arrival: spd_relation += 3; ddp_relation += 3; spd_right += 0.5; ddp_left += 0.5; union_coop += 1

In meetings with other union representatives, we are able to engage in dialogue regarding contentious issues in the German labor movement like the promotion of economic democracy. This has improved our relations with their affliated parties and pushed them towards common ground on economic issues.  

@newspaper
subtitle: -3 resources
choose-if: resources >= 3
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: workers_z += 2*(1-dissent); workers_z -= 1/3 if unemployed >= 15; workers_z -= 1/3 if unemployed >= 25; workers_z += 2*(1-dissent) if peoples_party == 1; resources -= 3

Our increased funding for the newspaper allows it to reach a broader group of workers and expand the reach of the <span style="color: #000000;">**Center Party**</span>.
